# 🎯 Guess The Number Game (Java)

A simple console-based Java project where the computer generates a random number and the user has to guess it with hints.

---

## 🚀 Features
- Random number generation (1 to 100)
- User input using Scanner
- Hints: "Too High" or "Too Low"
- Infinite attempts until correct guess
- Beginner-friendly logic using loops and conditions

---

## 🧠 Concepts Used
- Loops (`while`)
- Conditional statements (`if-else`)
- Random number generation
- User input handling
- Basic Java programming logic

---

